%% GitOps flow — from commit to running Pod, following cd.yml + Argo CD.
%% Render at https://mermaid.live — see README.md in this folder.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub (ci.yml / cd.yml)
    participant ACR as ACR (acr.azurecr.io)
    participant ARG as Argo CD (app-of-apps)
    participant K as Cluster (ecommerce ns)

    Note over D,GH: CI (pull request)
    D->>GH: push feature branch
    GH->>GH: ci.yml: Maven test (mvn -B test) — 17 services
    GH->>GH: ci.yml: docker build 17 images, gitleaks + trivy scan
    GH->>GH: ci.yml: kustomize build + helm lint (gate)

    Note over GH,ACR: CD (merge to main / env branch)
    GH->>ACR: build & push image <acr>.azurecr.io/<svc>:<sha>
    GH->>GH: GITOPS == argocd ? yq patch newTag:<sha> per env overlay (dev/staging/prod)
    GH->>GH: commit newTag rewrite to Git (Git is the source of truth)
    GH->>ARG: cd.yml triggers argocd app sync ecommerce-<env>

    Note over ARG,K: Argo CD reconciles Git → cluster
    ARG->>ARG: app-of-apps reads cluster/overlays/<env>
    ARG->>K: apply kustomize-rendered manifests (selfHeal + prune)
    K->>K: Kyverno admission: labels, no :latest, PSA restricted
    K-->>ARG: status Synced / Healthy
    ARG-->>GH: sync result (UI / health status)
    ARG-->>D: demo: http://<argo-cd-server> shows app tree

    Note over K,ACR: Runtime
    K->>ACR: imagePull acr.azurecr.io/<svc>:<sha>
    K->>K: HPA scales replicas; PDB protects drains